gun. The first green candle is a strong signal, you agree? Then, you can get in, and add to your winner if you see another confirmation of bulls' presence (second and third candles).\n\nI hope it helped.\n\nEDIT: Just so you know, and other readers too, we are not infallible: my first target was slightly higher and was not reached. The trades you saw yesterday all ended up at Break Even + a few after New York close.","a":"Emene","d":"","n":"#389","p":16,"im":["9de590441909dd52db655f29d0ea53f803f4535c"],"m":389},{"id":"supplydemand_p16_390","t":"Long GU. Edit: moved to BE want to make sure it clears small supply to left.","a":"turboguru","d":"","n":"#390","p":16,"im":["8d20681a03234c7acd2c76ecd9f02a2aea985a6a"],"m":390},{"id":"supplydemand_p16_391","t":"UCH 5m 3 drive into stacked demand. 1st 3 drive trade think I got it right? Edit:out BE","a":"turboguru","d":"","n":"#391","p":16,"im":["a7b1e212dcfd3fc5b0b15abf903b95eaf911853e"],"m":391},{"id":"supplydemand_p16_392","t":"Short EGB of good supply. Already closed 1. Don't usually hold over the weekend so a little risk here.","a":"turboguru","d":"","n":"#392","p":16,"im":["f02634bf6f266b3b063a4eb61967fa4d97230a60"],"m":392},{"id":"supplydemand_p16_393","t":"See EU H1 for QM level","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#393","p":16,"im":["c6c1b1467a7425790924ce7b1ddd699c37979749"],"m":393},{"id":"supplydemand_p16_394","t":"Was happy to take 17:1 on that May very well go lower, but that's a good RR run for me","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#394","p":16,"im":["b507d93383ee747b17405ecb2a150866c79db4c1"],"m":394},{"id":"supplydemand_p16_395","t":"Ifmyante wrote: Was happy to take 17:1 on that May very well go lower, but that's a good RR run for me\n\nU da devil\n\n666 thanks reaffirms it","a":"Frxter","d":"","n":"#395","p":16,"im":[],"m":395},{"id":"supplydemand_p16_396","t":"Hee hee. Just noticed","a":"Ifmyante","d":"","n":"#396","p":16,"im":[],"m":396},{"id":"supplydemand_p16_397","t":"hi If, could you draw where your qm was? ive just 